@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@usuarioId = 1a609d77-1e1e-4147-9386-5feaf46b3ca3
@condominioId = 13a9f78f-19ef-4804-b090-311242b1463c
@papelId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Adicionar papel válido (esperado: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "SINDICO",
  "ativo": true
}

### 2. Adicionar outro papel para o mesmo usuário no mesmo condomínio (esperado: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "MORADOR",
  "ativo": true
}

### 3. Papel com espaços nas bordas (deve normalizar com trim, esperado: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "  ZELADOR  ",
  "ativo": true
}

### 4. Papel duplicado para o mesmo usuário e condomínio (esperado: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "SINDICO",
  "ativo": true
}

### 5. Papel vazio (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "",
  "ativo": true
}

### 6. Papel com mais de 200 caracteres (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA",
  "ativo": true
}

### 7. usuarioId ausente (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "MORADOR",
  "ativo": true
}

### 8. condominioId ausente (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "{{usuarioId}}",
  "papel": "MORADOR",
  "ativo": true
}

### 9. Campos vazios ou nulos (esperado: 400 com todas as mensagens)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": null,
  "condominioId": null,
  "papel": "",
  "ativo": false
}

### 10. Usuário inexistente (esperado: 404 com o GlobalExceptionHandler; sem ele, 500)
POST {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "condominioId": "{{condominioId}}",
  "papel": "MORADOR",
  "ativo": true
}

### 11. Listar todos os papéis (esperado: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio

### 12. Listar papéis de um usuário (esperado: 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio/usuario/{{usuarioId}}

### 13. Desativar papel existente (esperado: 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio/{{papelId}}

### 14. Desativar papel inexistente (esperado: 404 com o advice; sem ele, 500)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/papel-condominio/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000